          description: 'Update project-level settings or speakers. action=update: change name/description via json {"name"?, "description"?}. action=speaker-update: project-wide rename/merge a speaker \u2014 {from:"A", to:"New name"} relabels every word of that speaker across all transcribed clips in the open project. speaker-create/speaker-delete are unsupported here (no speaker roster \u2014 speakers are per-word diarization labels); use speaker-update to relabel, or manage_transcript fix per clip.',
