          description: "Probe a media file with the ffprobe bundled in the app (no sandbox or API key needed). Returns measured duration, dimensions, average fps, stream presence/codecs, plus explicit qualityRisks (low resolution, mono, very short, variable/low frame rate). Accepts a media-pool assetId/prefix, local /media/\u2026 path, or public https URL. Use before finalize_uploaded_asset to pass hasAudioTrack and measured fps/duration. download_media/push_asset results already include the same measurements as `probe`, so do not re-probe a file you just imported. It fails only when the source cannot be read; finalize may then proceed with ingest defaults.",
