    id: "7ef378f4-bbee-4529-8e79-30d5591e3017",
    name: "Coordinates Weather Dashboard",
    category: "data-visualization",
    description: "A tactical weather station dashboard with topographic lines, crosshair grids, and rolling counter animations for temperature and pressure data.",
    width: 1920,
