    id: "c987c3d3-e85b-40cf-adca-44ca22b6215a",
    name: "Minimal Zoom Title Card",
    category: "title-cards",
    description: "A minimalist title card featuring white text on a black background, complete with a subtle continuous zoom and smooth fade transitions in and out.",
    width: 1920,
