    id: "d490ac7f-2e06-469d-ab59-0584094ac5da",
    name: "MindSpace \u2014 Kinetic Title Reveal",
    category: "uncategorized",
    description: "High-impact kinetic text overlay where large, bold text slides and smears in with horizontal motion blur sequentially, then exits aggressively in opposite directions. Designed for punchy talking-head edits.",
    width: 1920,
